# Layer 2 extra (FORMAT.md): the operators hiking-mountain and trekking do
# not use (sub, divide, min, max, xor, not, equal, v:), run on every golden
# way and node description by `Golden ops`.
---context:global
assign base 0.7
assign k = 3
---context:way
assign ms v:maxspeed
assign lanes v:lanes
assign hw switch highway=track 1.1 switch highway=path 2.3 switch highway=residential 0.9 0.37
assign costfactor divide hw k
assign turncost sub hw base
assign uphillcostfactor divide k hw
assign downhillcostfactor sub base hw
assign initialcost if lesser ms 45 then multiply ms 1.3 else 7
assign nodeaccessgranted xor reversedirection=yes highway=track
assign initialclassifier not equal ms 50
assign trafficsourcedensity min ms hw
assign istrafficbackbone max ms hw
assign priorityclassifier ms
assign classifiermask divide lanes 3
assign maxspeed divide 1 3
assign uphillcost sub divide ms 7 lanes
assign downhillcost divide ms 7
assign uphillcutoff greater ms 30
assign downhillcutoff or lesser lanes 2 and highway=path not reversedirection=yes
---context:node
assign initialcost sub 1 divide 1 3
